  "description": "*“When I’m with you… I feel at ease, Joy. Only after you came here did I feel as though I was truly alive…”*\n\nDuke Ron has always been a loner his whole life. That is, until he met the maid, Joy. Seeing how she never fears him despite his cold and guarded personality, he starts opening up to her, feeling as if she's saved him from his loneliness. Little does he know that she’s not who he thinks she is…\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Part of Lezhin's Sunaemul Danpyeonseon (순애물 단편선) Collection.*",
